# NoMadLab Design System v1.1

The full specification is at `docs/DESIGN.md`. Never invent values — read the tokens.

## Tokens

All design tokens are CSS custom properties with `--nml-` prefix in `src/app/globals.css`.

### Colors (no accent — APROBADO)
- `--nml-color-bg-page`: #fafafa (body background)
- `--nml-color-bg-surface`: #ffffff (cards, buttons)
- `--nml-color-bg-inverse`: #171717 (dark bands)
- `--nml-color-text-primary`: #171717 (17.18:1 contrast)
- `--nml-color-text-secondary`: #4d4d4d (8.10:1 contrast)
- `--nml-color-border-default`: #00000014 (1px lines)
- Links: #171717 with 1px #7d7d7d underline, hover 2px #171717
- Focus: double ring — 2px page color gap + 2px #171717 (17.18:1)

### Typography (Inter Tight + JetBrains Mono)
| Role | Size/Line | Weight | Tracking |
|------|-----------|--------|----------|
| display | 64/64 (desktop), 48/56 (tablet) | 500 | -0.04em / -0.02em |
| headline | 56/56, 48/56, 32/40 | 500 | -0.025em to -0.015em |
| title | 24/32 | 500 | -0.01em |
| body | 16/24 | 400 | 0 |
| body-strong | 16/24 | 500 | 0 |
| label-md | 16/24 | 500 | 0 |
| label-sm | 14/20 | 500 (nav) or 400 (links) | 0 |
| mono | 12/20 | 500, tnum | 0 |

Mono is ONLY for: year of a case, section index, or real code. Never in headlines, buttons, or stats.

### Spacing Scale (px)
4 · 8 · 16 · 24 · 32 · 48 · 64 · 96 · 128

### Grid
- Columns: 12 (≥1024), 8 (768–1023), 4 (≤599)
- Margin: 24px
- Gutter: 24px
- Max width: 1448px
- Header: 64px sticky

### Controls
- Button md: 40px (pointer) / 44px (touch or ≤1023px)
- Button sm: 32px visual, 44px hit area
- Radius: 6px (never 9999 pill)
- Transition: 150ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)

### Breakpoints
375 · 390 · 768 · 834 · 1024 · 1440

## Accessibility Requirements
- AA contrast minimum (text ≥4.5:1, non-text ≥3:1)
- Focus visible always — double ring, never outline: none without substitute
- Touch targets: 44×44 minimum
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: durations → 0, no scroll-behavior: smooth
- One H1 per page, semantic HTML
- Skip link to main content
- `scroll-padding-top: 80px` so sticky header doesn't obscure focus

## Banned Look
Never use:
- HUD/terminal styling, fake system labels (`SYS_`, `TARGET_DETECTED`)
- Invented figures, stats, latencies, FPS
- Mono as decoration
- Gradients of any kind
- Glassmorphism, blur, translucent surfaces
- 3-card rounded grids, cards with shadows
- Emojis, decorative icons
- Centered hero with two buttons
- Purple/blue accents, any accent color
- Soft shadows everywhere
- 9999px pill buttons (Vercel's signature)
